    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439080/extras/fde31c016a942ea58d835d251013ef23.avif?t=1738584013\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Football Like Never Before with VR Football Heading Challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>VR Football Heading Challenge</i> brings the thrill of football into a fully immersive VR experience. Designed for players of all levels, this game combines fun, competition, and skill-building in dynamic gameplay. Perfect your headers, master your timing, and rise to the top in various challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439080/extras/8b727cf96a78f5711ef384fd6c7dca25.avif?t=1738584013\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game offers three distinct modes to keep the action fresh:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Mode (Arcade):</strong> Hone your skills by heading the ball to knock down targets and score points in a fast-paced, action-packed environment. Perfect for casual and competitive players alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Mode:</strong> Dive into structured drills designed to improve your precision and timing. With personalized feedback and increasing difficulty, this mode helps you refine your skills step by step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode:</strong> Test your skills against friends or global players in real-time. Compete in high-stakes matches to see who can achieve the best headers under pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439080/extras/d3071e8dde8db3ff1f46953bea7df1bb.avif?t=1738584013\" width=800 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic physics, intuitive controls, and vibrant environments, <i>VR Football Heading Challenge</i> delivers a balanced mix of fun and competition. Whether you\u2019re a football enthusiast or looking for a unique workout experience, this game is designed to keep you engaged. Are you ready to use your head?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439080/extras/fde31c016a942ea58d835d251013ef23.avif?t=1738584013\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Football Like Never Before with VR Football Heading Challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>VR Football Heading Challenge</i> brings the thrill of football into a fully immersive VR experience. Designed for players of all levels, this game combines fun, competition, and skill-building in dynamic gameplay. Perfect your headers, master your timing, and rise to the top in various challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439080/extras/8b727cf96a78f5711ef384fd6c7dca25.avif?t=1738584013\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game offers three distinct modes to keep the action fresh:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Mode (Arcade):</strong> Hone your skills by heading the ball to knock down targets and score points in a fast-paced, action-packed environment. Perfect for casual and competitive players alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Mode:</strong> Dive into structured drills designed to improve your precision and timing. With personalized feedback and increasing difficulty, this mode helps you refine your skills step by step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mode:</strong> Test your skills against friends or global players in real-time. Compete in high-stakes matches to see who can achieve the best headers under pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439080/extras/d3071e8dde8db3ff1f46953bea7df1bb.avif?t=1738584013\" width=800 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic physics, intuitive controls, and vibrant environments, <i>VR Football Heading Challenge</i> delivers a balanced mix of fun and competition. Whether you\u2019re a football enthusiast or looking for a unique workout experience, this game is designed to keep you engaged. Are you ready to use your head?</p>",
